WEBVTT

00:07:59.288 --> 00:08:01.163
basically to remove all hallways,

00:08:01.913 --> 00:08:05.704
to increase the height of the wards
so that we got, you know,

00:08:05.746 --> 00:08:08.871
both sun and air movement
as the WTO prescribes,

00:08:08.871 --> 00:08:13.246
but also had plenty of space for
patients to walk around.

00:08:13.246 --> 00:08:18.746
And our precedents were TB sanatoriums
designed in the 20s and 30s,

00:08:19.038 --> 00:08:22.038
medical facilities designed
in the 19th century,

00:08:22.038 --> 00:08:27.079
like Florence Nightingale and Alver Alto
and these incredible designers who were

00:08:27.079 --> 00:08:31.913
thinking about airflow before the advent
of HVAC or mechanical ventilation,